WEBVTT

00:11.030 --> 00:12.150
Don't run away!

01:28.530 --> 01:33.070
（Tomohari Someron Bath Conditioner）

01:29.030 --> 01:31.620
That Suzuka...

01:41.930 --> 01:44.670
Suzuka-chan, let's take a bath together!

01:51.330 --> 01:53.100
Ken-chan, how come you're here?

01:53.130 --> 01:56.130
What are you doing here?

01:56.130 --> 01:58.050
I thought Suzuka-chan was in here.

02:00.130 --> 02:01.390
Nanami?

02:05.430 --> 02:08.340
Ah, you guys make such a cute couple.

02:09.030 --> 02:10.630
It's not like that...

02:11.330 --> 02:12.730
You'll get cold.

02:12.730 --> 02:14.270
Go on in and take your bath.

02:28.230 --> 02:29.450
H-Hey, Ken-chan

02:29.630 --> 02:30.680
What?

02:31.470 --> 02:33.760
Don't you think the bath water is really hot?

02:34.030 --> 02:35.260
Is it?

02:35.330 --> 02:36.710
Yeah.

02:37.730 --> 02:41.070
I... I can't stand it any longer.

02:45.330 --> 02:48.020
Hey! Hey! Are you okay!?

02:48.230 --> 02:49.870
Hey, Nanami!

02:51.230 --> 02:53.100
Nanami, hang in there!

02:53.530 --> 02:56.940
Dad! Oba-san!

02:59.110 --> 03:03.910
The Summer Field and the Nanami Special

03:38.130 --> 03:40.870
Yeah! It's very beautiful today, too.

03:48.830 --> 03:50.510
What is this place?

03:52.430 --> 03:54.150
What is this?

03:56.030 --> 03:58.300
Ken-chan, it's morning already.

03:59.030 --> 04:02.130
Huh? Where are you, Ken-chan?

04:02.510 --> 04:05.900
Nanami, I'm over here. Nanami!

04:13.830 --> 04:14.700
Nanami...

04:16.530 --> 04:19.690
Ken-chan, what are you doing there?

04:25.430 --> 04:27.240
Does it taste good, Suzuka-chan?

04:29.230 --> 04:31.360
Nanami-oneechan's cooking is the best.

04:31.730 --> 04:34.030
It would be great if you could cook like this, Suzuka.

04:34.030 --> 04:38.950
Hey! When I'm serious about it, my cooking is just as good as this.

04:39.530 --> 04:41.560
Well, then be serious... at least once in a while.

04:42.030 --> 04:44.590
I can't stand having burnt toast for breakfast anymore.

04:44.600 --> 04:46.430
You're not exactly a master chef either.

04:46.430 --> 04:52.030
It's all right. If you practice a little more, you'll be a very good cook.

04:52.060 --> 04:55.970
Did you hear that? Nanami-oneechan said I'm alright.

04:59.700 --> 05:00.960
Do you want some more?

05:10.130 --> 05:11.260
Nanami-oneechan is the best.

05:11.730 --> 05:12.750
What's wrong?

05:14.430 --> 05:16.610
No, no. Nothing's wrong at all.

05:26.110 --> 05:29.520
Ah! Oh yeah, you want some tea, right?

05:31.110 --> 05:32.910
Ah! H-H-Hot!

05:34.130 --> 05:35.480
Are you alright?

05:37.330 --> 05:40.120
Don't compete over such stupid things!

05:42.530 --> 05:43.890
My bad, my bad.

05:52.710 --> 05:53.830
Good morning, Tomosaka.

05:53.830 --> 05:54.880
Yo, what's up?

05:54.930 --> 05:56.320
Good morning, Konoe-san.

05:57.130 --> 05:58.110
Hi. Good morning.

05:58.830 --> 06:00.960
You're such a good couple.

06:02.120 --> 06:04.690
Your wife is having a hard time, Tomosaka-kun.

06:04.730 --> 06:05.600
Shut up.

06:07.330 --> 06:09.630
Later, Tomosaka-kun, Konoe-san.

06:13.430 --> 06:15.150
Ken-chan.

06:18.830 --> 06:20.030
Konoe-san.

06:20.610 --> 06:24.090
Ah? What's the matter?

06:24.360 --> 06:26.360
Nothing, I was just saying...

06:26.830 --> 06:28.470
W-well...

06:29.230 --> 06:30.610
Tomosaka-kun...

06:42.630 --> 06:44.130
I was just saying, too.

06:47.130 --> 06:49.170
It's nothing really, Konoe-san.

06:49.910 --> 06:51.110
Yeah.

06:53.080 --> 06:55.340
I understand, Tomosaka-kun.

06:56.400 --> 06:58.150
Let's go.

07:25.860 --> 07:27.340
Yo, Kenji.

07:29.540 --> 07:31.040
What are you gonna do this year?

07:32.480 --> 07:33.290
What are you talking about?

07:33.530 --> 07:35.650
What do you think I'm talking about? The annual field trip of course.

07:37.540 --> 07:39.830
I heard this year we're going camping at the lake.

07:39.830 --> 07:42.000
Summer is the best time for going to the mountains.

07:42.730 --> 07:44.230
Hmm, yeah.

07:44.230 --> 07:46.240
Seems like you are not interested at all.

07:46.730 --> 07:49.650
Well, not really. I'm just kind of annoyed.

07:50.730 --> 07:51.900
What are you talking about?

07:52.330 --> 07:54.190
We can go swim in the lake!

07:54.230 --> 07:57.620
And we can see many girls in their swimsuits.

07:57.730 --> 07:59.640
Are you still a man?

07:59.930 --> 08:02.050
But you can see that on the beach as well.

08:02.080 --> 08:05.330
Idiot! Wearing swimsuits on the beach is a must.

08:05.430 --> 08:07.830
It would be better to see girls with their swimsuits on in the lake.

08:09.030 --> 08:10.350
Really?

08:11.430 --> 08:12.770
Excuse me, Wife.

08:12.780 --> 08:15.600
Huh? Me?

08:16.730 --> 08:18.550
Who else could that be besides you?

08:19.730 --> 08:23.480
May I borrow your husband for a while? Do you mind?

08:24.310 --> 08:27.770
Huh? Ken-chan is the husband?

08:29.430 --> 08:34.190
Ken-chan is Tomosaka-kun. And if Tomosaka-kun is my husband...

08:35.030 --> 08:37.160
Then am I Tomosaka-san?

08:37.520 --> 08:38.950
But... but...

08:40.030 --> 08:42.250
But...

08:42.290 --> 08:44.810
Stop acting stupid. Let's go home already.

08:45.330 --> 08:47.330
Yeah, Tomosaka-kun.

08:47.330 --> 08:49.770
Idi... stop saying that.

08:53.130 --> 08:56.530
But... it feels very strange...

08:56.530 --> 08:57.590
Hey, Kenji.

08:57.630 --> 08:58.780
What is it now?

08:58.830 --> 09:01.530
I forgot to ask you the most important question.

09:05.920 --> 09:07.970
Hikari-chan will come this year too, right?

09:09.240 --> 09:10.450
Who knows?

09:11.130 --> 09:14.450
Can't you just make sure, Tomosaka Kenji-kun?

09:15.430 --> 09:17.510
What are you talking about?

09:20.230 --> 09:22.240
Hikari-chan will come, right?

09:22.530 --> 09:26.810
As her cousin, you must know the answer to this question.

09:28.430 --> 09:30.460
I-I think she will...

09:30.530 --> 09:32.880
No, I will! I will make her come this year!

09:34.130 --> 09:36.750
Really? Good, good.

09:38.630 --> 09:41.980
Hi, everybody, I heard that Hikari-chan is coming this year too.

09:47.430 --> 09:49.820
Geez, that Hatano...

09:50.330 --> 09:52.300
Hikari-chan is very popular.

09:52.310 --> 09:56.420
Yeah. Those ignorant idiots... They don't know her true colors.

09:56.430 --> 09:58.740
But I'm looking forward to this year's field trip too.

09:58.810 --> 10:01.320
That's because you and Hikari are good friends.

10:01.930 --> 10:05.270
It's not just about Hikari-chan... I'm looking forward to the field trip too.

10:05.830 --> 10:06.710
Excuse me...

10:33.830 --> 10:36.930
What's wrong? You're Sakura-san, right?

10:39.730 --> 10:41.090
Ah, yeah.

10:43.030 --> 10:44.170
Is there anything I can help you with?

10:44.610 --> 10:47.290
Umm, well...

10:49.330 --> 10:51.240
Good afternoon, Tomosaka-senpai!

10:51.530 --> 10:53.590
Oh, good afternoon.

10:55.660 --> 10:58.890
Are you going to the field trip this year?

10:58.930 --> 11:01.020
Yeah, I go every single year.

11:01.230 --> 11:02.240
I see.

11:03.430 --> 11:04.520
That's great!

11:04.730 --> 11:05.710
Anything wrong with this?

11:05.810 --> 11:08.900
Ah, it's nothing.

11:09.630 --> 11:13.250
Well, I'm looking foward to seeing you on the field trip.

11:18.730 --> 11:19.420
What was that?

11:19.730 --> 11:22.390
Ken-chan knows Sakura-san from before?

11:22.400 --> 11:24.100
Yeah, she is Suzuka's friend.

11:25.230 --> 11:27.080
She always comes over to my place to play.

11:28.330 --> 11:31.800
I still remember that she used to give me chocolates on Valentine's Day.

11:39.130 --> 11:41.170
That chocolate was so delicious.

11:41.530 --> 11:44.220
But what did she mean just now?

11:46.730 --> 11:49.630
Maybe she will confess her love to me.

11:49.630 --> 11:50.980
That would definitely put me into a weird situation.

11:51.030 --> 11:54.290
That girl has a cute face and a good personality.

11:56.630 --> 11:58.870
I've had enough of this. I'm going home, Tomosaka-kun.

12:02.730 --> 12:06.560
Stupi... Didn't I tell you not to call me Tomosaka-kun?

12:07.930 --> 12:09.480
Wait! Nanami!!

12:57.930 --> 13:00.310
Why'd he get so excited all of a sudden?

13:02.330 --> 13:03.870
It seems like she's mad now.

13:04.530 --> 13:05.720
No, well...

13:05.830 --> 13:07.820
It's hard to be a husband, isn't it?

13:08.130 --> 13:10.300
Oba-san, please don't say that.

13:11.930 --> 13:13.520
Here you go. Sorry to keep you waiting.

13:19.730 --> 13:21.200
I'm eating.

13:24.530 --> 13:28.190
The school field trip is soon, right? Where are you going this time?

13:28.210 --> 13:31.140
Well, we're going to camp by the lake.

13:31.830 --> 13:34.890
Really? That's certainly something to be looking forward to.

13:36.630 --> 13:37.630
Well, that's...

13:37.630 --> 13:39.930
You're not looking forward to it?

13:39.970 --> 13:41.860
No... I'm really looking forward to it.

13:42.530 --> 13:44.330
I can't wait!

13:44.330 --> 13:45.440
Here's your coffee.

13:45.730 --> 13:48.800
Stupi... Watch where you're putting things!

13:54.830 --> 13:56.670
How long are you going to be mad at me?

13:56.700 --> 13:59.480
What? I'm not mad at you.

14:00.120 --> 14:02.330
Look at you, you don't think you look a bit too excited?

14:03.230 --> 14:05.010
You're so persistent.

14:13.130 --> 14:16.230
Alright, I'm not going this year.

14:17.930 --> 14:19.970
I didn't want to go in the first place.

14:20.030 --> 14:21.870
And I need to fix my motorcycle as soon as possible anyway.

14:23.030 --> 14:25.820
In that case, I'll need your help with the store.

14:26.260 --> 14:27.990
Huh? What?

14:28.030 --> 14:31.680
Since Tomosaka-kun isn't going, you weren't planning on going either right, Nanami?

14:35.930 --> 14:37.610
It's been like that forever.

14:37.630 --> 14:40.490
Nanami, you've always done what Tomosaka-kun has done.

14:40.530 --> 14:43.060
That's not true!

14:47.730 --> 14:49.300
Ah, really?

14:49.330 --> 14:51.920
If Tomosaka-kun wasn't going to school, you...

14:52.030 --> 14:56.210
Ah, I almost forgot! I have to water the vegetables in the field!

14:58.330 --> 15:00.170
Hey, Ken-chan! Hurry up!

15:00.930 --> 15:02.640
No, I'm still having my coffee.

15:06.530 --> 15:07.990
I see.

15:17.530 --> 15:21.680
Geez, Mom always recalls the embarrassing things that happened when we were younger.

15:22.130 --> 15:24.790
But, because you were always following me, I had a really hard time.

15:24.830 --> 15:25.730
Why?

15:25.730 --> 15:30.410
That's because if I wasn't going to school, you wouldn't go either.

15:30.530 --> 15:33.310
Because of you, I couldn't even take a day off when I was sick.

15:34.230 --> 15:35.510
What are you talking about?

15:35.730 --> 15:39.750
I saw you were lonely at home. I was just trying to take care of you.

15:39.780 --> 15:42.760
Didn't you just read comics when I was sick?

15:42.830 --> 15:47.660
That's not true. I cooked rice soup for you.

15:48.930 --> 15:50.710
Did you really?

16:02.830 --> 16:05.130
That's hot!

16:10.530 --> 16:11.970
That's mean.

16:12.530 --> 16:15.030
But I had a hard time too.

16:15.030 --> 16:15.880
How so?

16:16.130 --> 16:20.230
Weren't you the same? If I wasn't going to go to school, you wouldn't go either.

16:21.730 --> 16:22.600
That's because...

16:23.030 --> 16:26.830
It was the same. If I was sick and wanted to stay at home...

16:26.830 --> 16:28.750
I couldn't do that because I didn't want you to miss school. It was really hard for me too.

16:29.330 --> 16:30.390
No...

16:31.930 --> 16:33.170
I was only...

16:35.130 --> 16:36.730
If you're alone...

16:37.230 --> 16:41.930
If you're alone... then what?

16:42.730 --> 16:43.710
Well...

16:46.230 --> 16:47.120
So.

16:58.730 --> 17:00.940
Well, that was...

17:02.530 --> 17:03.620
That was...

17:05.930 --> 17:07.950
Because of that...

17:22.900 --> 17:24.790
Hah, you're all soaked.

17:27.430 --> 17:29.840
Alright, let's start watering.

17:31.440 --> 17:35.690
Na... na... mi!!!

17:38.830 --> 17:41.100
You evil girl! Stop there!

17:46.220 --> 17:48.770
Now you have nowhere to run Konoe Nanami-kun!

17:49.270 --> 17:52.450
I'm sorry, really!

17:52.580 --> 17:54.430
You have no choice but to defend!

17:55.560 --> 17:59.640
I'd like to resolve this through a peaceful solution...

18:00.010 --> 18:02.500
Now she loses heart!

18:02.870 --> 18:06.470
I'm willing to surrender if I'll be treated humanely.

18:06.990 --> 18:10.270
Don't worry, I can't kill women and children.

18:10.760 --> 18:12.640
I am a girl!!

18:12.780 --> 18:14.390
It doesn't matter!

18:16.820 --> 18:19.260
No, don't!

18:21.540 --> 18:23.420
Ken-chan is mean!

18:23.530 --> 18:24.800
It's your own fault!

18:33.670 --> 18:34.610
Ken-chan?

18:42.420 --> 18:45.560
Today let me see something exceptionally interesting...

18:47.830 --> 18:50.350
Whose fault is this!?

19:21.850 --> 19:23.250
How's it going?

19:24.250 --> 19:25.610
So so.

19:26.650 --> 19:28.660
It seems like this year isn't as easy.

19:28.750 --> 19:31.200
That's because I was riding it all the time.

19:31.350 --> 19:32.930
It'll probably take a while to fix.

19:33.750 --> 19:36.150
I also want to make it look brand new again.

19:38.110 --> 19:39.210
Alright.

20:06.250 --> 20:10.740
Looks like you have to get some new parts.

20:11.450 --> 20:12.030
I've gotta run.

20:13.450 --> 20:14.320
Hey, Dad...

20:16.450 --> 20:19.090
Could you please give me some pocket money?

20:22.250 --> 20:23.420
Alright.

20:24.150 --> 20:25.880
But you need to do me a favor.

20:27.850 --> 20:30.120
Hikari-chan will be here tomorrow.

20:31.050 --> 20:32.260
Dad, that means...

20:33.450 --> 20:36.860
Please clean a room for her. Later.

20:41.150 --> 20:42.920
W-Wait, Dad!

20:44.350 --> 20:45.390
I'll pay you in advance.

20:47.150 --> 20:49.610
And it needs to be done by noon tomorrow.

20:54.050 --> 20:55.470
Please do it.

20:59.840 --> 21:03.060
That room... That room!

21:03.850 --> 21:08.450
How could I possibly clean it up in one night!!!!

21:34.450 --> 21:37.520
Sakura-san, I have something I want to ask you...

21:37.750 --> 21:39.040
What is it?

21:39.150 --> 21:41.690
What's your relationship with Ken-chan?

21:41.850 --> 21:43.150
That's...

21:43.150 --> 21:45.150
Did you make that chocolate by yourself?

21:45.150 --> 21:46.150
Well...

21:46.150 --> 21:47.730
You made it by yourself, right?

21:47.850 --> 21:49.520
Y... Yeah.

21:49.660 --> 21:51.360
Ehhh!

21:52.450 --> 21:55.870
Next Time on Lamune: The Little Cousin and the Fireworks

21:56.550 --> 21:59.350
Ken-chan, what is this?

21:58.160 --> 22:03.160
